-- Parser cases for syntax the Cores don't parse yet, in broken.talk's format.
-- Only `bun tools/grammar/check.ts` reads this file, so the Cores' fixture
-- tests don't fail on it. Each case moves into broken.talk, or its source
-- into a sketch, when both Cores parse it.

-- case: a Clause Shape after a parameter (ADR 0171)
-- expect: parses
on handle inv is an Invoice where the amount of inv > 1000
  send review with inv to approvals
end handle

-- case: a Clause Shape before an Argument Label keeps the Selector
-- expect: parses
on move item is a Thing to place is a Place
  return place
end move

-- case: Clause Shapes on comma-separated parameters, one a kind
-- expect: parses
on scale factor is a number, shape
  return factor
end scale

-- case: a Clause Shape after a Destructuring pattern and its `as`
-- expect: parses
on handle {amount: a} as inv is an Invoice, queued
  return a
end handle

-- case: a Clause Shape on a Fallback Handler
-- expect: parses
on any message {name: n} is a Request
  pass any message
end any message

-- case: `is not a` in a head parses, and the loader refuses it
-- expect: parses
on handle inv is not an Invoice
  return inv
end handle

-- case: a Clause Shape needs `a` or `an`
-- expect: unexpected token at 1:18
on handle inv is Invoice
  return inv
end handle
